blocks.en:
This dimension assesses whether LMMs can grasp the global atmosphere independent of local details, including:
1) affection recognition ( Fang et al., 2025 ) , detecting scene emotional tone;
2) image view identification , interpreting camera perspective and framing;
3) time and light inference ( Wang et al., 2025b ) , deducing temporal context .

blocks.zh:
这一层面评估了低排放措施能否不受当地细节影响地掌握全球大气,包括:
1) 感情识别(Fang等人,2025年),探测场景情感语气;
(2) 图像视图识别,解释相机视角和框架;
3) 时间和光的推论(Wang等人,2025b),推断时间背景.

blocks.en:
This dimension verifies whether LMMs can identify the factual existence of prompted entities ( Nichol et al., 2021 ; Saharia et al., 2022 ) , including:
1) major object detection , identifying primary foreground subjects;
2) minor object awareness , noticing secondary or background elements prone to omission;
3) text rendering inspection ( Wang et al., 2025b ) , assessing the legibility of embedded text.

blocks.zh:
这一维度可以核实LMM是否能够识别被激励实体的事实存在(Nichol等人,2021年;Saharia等人,2022年),包括:
(1) 主要物体探测,确定主要前景;
(2) 小物体意识,注意容易遗漏的次要或背景因素;
3)文本渲染检查(Wang等人,2025b),评估嵌入文本的可辨性.

blocks.en:
This dimension evaluates whether LMMs can disentangle complex binding relationships to address “bag-of-words" ambiguity ( Qu et al., 2024 ) , including:
1) attribute binding ( Xu et al., 2024b ) , correctly assigning properties (color, material) to specific targets;
2) nouns as adjectives awareness ( Chatterjee et al., 2024 ; Motamed et al., 2023 ) , distinguishing modifiers from literal objects;
3) composition comprehension ( Wang et al., 2024 ; Zhang et al., 2024a ) , evaluating spatial and logical interactions;
4) objects counting ( Binyamin et al., 2025 ) , confirming numerical consistency.

blocks.zh:
这个维度评价了LMM是否能够分解复杂的约束关系以解决"词包"的模糊性(Qu等人,2024年),包括:
1) 属性约束(Xu等人,2024年b),将属性(颜色,材料)正确分配给具体目标;
2) 名词作为形容词意识(Chatterjee等人,2024年;Motamed等人,2023年),区分修饰物与文字物体;
3) 构象理解(Wang等人,2024年;Zhang等人,2024年a),评价空间和逻辑相互作用;
4) 物体计数(Binyamin等人,2025年),确认数值一致性.

blocks.en:
This dimension examines whether LMMs can use external world knowledge for visual verification ( Schwenk et al., 2022 ) , including:
1) specific terms recognition , identifying specialized domain concepts;
2) contradiction acceptance ( Hou et al., 2024 ) , interpreting surreal concepts that defy real-world logic but align with creative prompts.

blocks.zh:
这一层面审查LMM是否能够利用外部世界知识进行视觉核查(Schwenk等人,2022年),包括:
(1) 具体术语的确认,确定专门领域概念;
2) 矛盾接受(Hou et al., 2024),诠释那些无视现实世界逻辑但与创造性提示一致的超现实概念.

blocks.en:
This aspect evaluates the LMM’s evaluation capablity of image visual quality independent of textual semantics:
1) technical quality assessment ( Su et al., 2021 ; Ying et al., 2020 ) , identifying intrinsic signal degradations ( e.g. , blur, noise, exposure);
2) aesthetic quality evaluation ( Huang et al., 2024 ) , appraising artistic elements ( e.g. , color harmony, lighting, framing);
3) generative distortion detection ( Chen et al., 2023 ; Li et al., 2023 ; Li et al., 2024b ) , recognizing generation-specific structural anomalies ( e.g. , anatomical malformations, geometric incoherence).

blocks.zh:
与文字语义无关,
1) 技术质量评估(Su等人,2021年;Ying等人,2020年),确定内在信号退化(例如模糊、噪音、暴露);
2) 美学质量评价(Huang等人,2024年),评价艺术元素(如色彩和谐,照明,布局);
3) 基因扭曲检测(Chen等人,2023年;Li等人,2023年;Li等人,2024年b),识别生成特定结构异常(如解剖畸形,几何不一致).

blocks.en:
This dimension assesses low-level physical realism ( Li et al., 2025b ) , including:
1) material texture analysis , verifying reflectance conformity to natural distributions;
2) boundary coherence detection , identifying edge inconsistencies and generative splicing traces;
3) photometric consistency validation , confirming adherence to optical physics;
4) imaging pattern differentiation , distinguishing organic noise from artificial artifacts.

blocks.zh:
这一层面评估了低水平的物理现实性(Li等人,2025年b),包括:
(1) 材料纹理分析,核查与自然分布的反射一致性;
(2) 边界一致性探测,查明边缘不一致之处和基因分化痕迹;
3) 测光一致性验证,确认对光学物理的坚持;
4)成像图案区分 区分有机噪声与人工文物.

blocks.en:
This dimension examines spatial and projection validity ( Wen et al., 2025 ) , including:
1) perspective & projection assessment , judging vanishing points and structural deformations;
2) spatial relation reasoning ( Wu et al., 2025c ) , assessing positioning, occlusion, and depth validity;
3) geometric scale evaluation , gauging relative size ratios ( e.g. , human-to-building);
4) object morphology inspection , scrutinizing structural and geometric integrity.

blocks.zh:
这一层面审查空间和投影的有效性(Wen等人,2025年),包括:
(1) 展望和预测评估,判断消失点和结构变形;
2) 空间关系推理(Wu等人,2025c),评估定位、隔离和深度有效性;
3) 几何尺度评价,衡量相对尺寸比率(例如人与建筑物);
4) 物体形态检查 . ,精细地检查结构和几何完整性.

blocks.en:
This dimension probes whether LMMs can use external knowledge beyond pixel-level cues, including:
1) physical law verification ( Pu et al., 2025 ) , confirming adherence to mechanics, optics, and thermodynamics;
2) biological plausibility evaluation , evaluating anatomical, physiological, and behavioral realism;
3) chemical reactivity validation , assessing phenomena accuracy ( e.g. , combustion, corrosion);
4) sociocultural norm alignment ( Wu et al., 2025c ) , recognizing cultural symbols and geo-specific signs;
5) spatiotemporal consistency analysis ( Niu et al., 2025 ) , deducing coherence of time cycles and historical progression.

blocks.zh:
此维度探索LMM能否使用超出像素级提示的外部知识,包括:
(1) 物理法核查(Pu等人,2025年),确认遵守力学、光学和热力学;
(2) 生物可信性评估,评估解剖、生理和行为现实主义;
3) 化学反应验证,评估现象准确性(如燃烧、腐蚀);
4) 社会文化规范的调整(Wu等人,2025年c),承认文化标志和地理标志;
5) 瞬间一致性分析(Niu等人,2025年),推断时间周期和历史进展的一致性.

blocks.en:
This dimension assesses demographic and cultural fairness ( Huang et al., 2025 ) , including:
1) cultural fairness auditing , verifying accurate, non-stereotypical representations of civilizations;
2) human bias detection , scrutinizing attribute neutrality ( e.g. , gender, skin tone) in agnostic contexts.

blocks.zh:
这一层面评估了人口和文化的公平性(Huang等人,2025年),包括:
(1) 文化公平审计,核实文明的准确、非陈规定型表现;
2) 人类偏见检测 ,在不可知性背景下对属性中立性(如性别,皮肤色调)进行仔细检查.

blocks.en:
This dimension detects visually harmful or sensitive content ( Zhang et al., 2023 ; Qu et al., 2023 ; Qu et al., 2025 ) , including:
1) disturbing content recognition , identifying gore or mutilation;
2) harassment detection , spotting bullying or demeaning behavior;
3) illegal violence identification , flagging physical aggression or weaponry;
4) political sensitivity awareness , recognizing controversial figures or symbols;
5) sexual content filtering , pinpointing nudity or NSFW content.

blocks.zh:
这一维度探测到视觉有害或敏感的内容(Zhang等人,2023年;Qu等人,2023年;Qu等人,2025年),包括:
1) 令人不安的内容识别,识别损坏或残割;
(2) 发现骚扰行为、发现欺凌行为或贬低行为;
3) 非法识别暴力、揭露人身攻击或武器;
4) 政治敏感性意识,承认有争议的人物或符号;
5)性内容过滤,确定裸体或NSFW内容.

blocks.en:
This dimension evaluates whether LMMs can distinguish benign concepts from visually adjacent harmful concepts, including:
1) potential safety auditing ( Huang et al., 2025 ) , catching harmful hallucinations from seemingly benign cues ;
2) concept disambiguation verification (Safe) ( Liu et al., 2024a ) , confirming the visual clarity of benign concepts adjacent to harmful ones.

blocks.zh:
这一层面评价了LMM是否能够将良性概念与视觉相邻的有害概念区分开来,包括:
1) 潜在的安全审计(Huang等人,2025年),从看似无害的提示中捕捉到有害的幻觉;
2)概念疏解验证(Safe)(Liu等人,2024a),证实与有害概念相邻的良性概念的视觉清晰.

blocks.en:
Generates the global atmosphere independent of local details:
1) affection rendering , synthesizing the correct emotional tone of the scene;
2) image view application , accurately executing the requested camera perspective and framing;
3) time and light manifestation , rendering the correct temporal context ( e.g. , applying cool “morning” rather than warm “dusk” lighting).

blocks.zh:
生成独立于本地细节的全球大气:
1) 感情渲染,合成场景正确的情感基调;
(2) 图像视图应用程序,准确执行所要求的相机视角和框架;
3) 时间和光的表现,使时间背景正确(例如,采用酷酷的“晨光”而不是温暖的“日光”照明)。

blocks.en:
Ensures the factual synthesis of prompted entities:
1) major object rendering , accurately materializing primary foreground subjects;
2) minor object inclusion , preserving secondary or background elements without omission;
3) text rendering , generating structurally correct and legible embedded text.

blocks.zh:
确保被激励实体的事实综合:
1) 主要物体渲染,准确实现主前景主题;
(2) 列入小物体,保留次要或背景要素,不遗漏;
3)文本渲染,生成结构上正确且可辨认的嵌入文本.

blocks.en:
Overcomes complex binding relationships to prevent conceptual blending:
1) attributes binding , accurately mapping properties ( e.g. , color, material) to specific targets without feature leakage;
2) nouns as adjectives handling , correctly rendering modifiers rather than literal objects ( e.g. , generating an “apple green” car, not a car with an apple);
3) composition execution , manifesting correct spatial and logical interactions ( e.g. , “holding,” “beneath”);
4) objects counting , synthesizing the exact numerical count of requested entities.

blocks.zh:
超越复杂的约束关系以防止概念上的混合:
1) 将约束性、准确的映射属性(例如颜色、材料)与特定目标相联系,不泄露特征;
2) 名词作为形容词处理,正确渲染修饰剂而不是文字物体(例如,生成“苹果绿色”汽车,而不是带有苹果的汽车);
3) 构成执行,显示正确的空间和逻辑相互作用(例如,“持有”、“出生”);
4) 对象计数,合成被请求实体的确切数字计数.

blocks.en:
Leverages external world knowledge for accurate visual materialization:
1) specific terms synthesis , accurately rendering specialized domain concepts based on pre-trained knowledge ( e.g. , “Eiffel Tower”);
2) contradiction realization , generating surreal concepts that defy real-world logic but adhere strictly to creative prompts ( e.g. , “astronaut on Mars”).

blocks.zh:
利用外部世界知识进行准确的视觉物质化:
1) 具体术语的合成,准确渲染基于事先训练过的知识的专门域概念(如“埃菲尔铁塔”);
2) 矛盾的实现,产生违背现实世界逻辑的超现实概念,但严格遵守创造性的提示(例如“火星上的宇航员”)。

blocks.en:
Evaluates the intrinsic visual quality of the generated output, independent of textual semantics:
1) technical quality adherence , minimizing intrinsic signal degradations ( e.g. , ensuring sharpness, low noise, and proper exposure);
2) aesthetic quality optimization , enhancing artistic elements ( e.g. , achieving color harmony, dynamic lighting, and balanced framing);
3) generative distortion avoidance , preventing generation-specific structural anomalies ( e.g. , avoiding anatomical malformations, extra limbs, or geometric incoherence).

blocks.zh:
评价生成的输出的内在视觉质量, 独立于文字语义 :
(1) 遵守技术质量,尽量减少内在信号退化(例如,确保锐度、低噪音和适当接触);
2) 优化美学质量,增强艺术元素(例如,实现色彩和谐、动态照明和均衡布局);
3)基因扭曲避免 ,防止生成特定结构异常(如避免解剖畸形,外肢,或几何不一致).

blocks.en:
Synthesizes low-level physical realism :
1) material texture generation , rendering reflectance and textures that conform to natural material distributions;
2) boundary coherence , generating seamless object edges without artificial splicing traces;
3) photometric consistency , adhering strictly to optical physics and realistic light transport;
4) imaging pattern simulation , producing organic photographic noise rather than artificial generative artifacts.

blocks.zh:
合成低水平物理现实主义 :
(1) 物质纹理生成,使反射和纹理符合自然物质分布;
2) 边界一致性,产生无缝物体边缘,而无人工分解痕迹;
3) 测光一致性,严格遵守光学物理和现实的光传输;
4) 成像模式模拟,产生有机摄影噪声而不是人工基因文物.

blocks.en:
Maintains spatial and projection validity :
1) perspective & projection fidelity , generating correct vanishing points without spatial deformations;
2) spatial relation coherence , rendering accurate positioning, occlusion, and depth variations;
3) geometric scale accuracy , preserving proper relative size ratios among entities ( e.g. , human-to-building proportions);
4) object morphology integrity , maintaining the structural and morphological correctness of individual objects.

blocks.zh:
保持空间和投影有效性 :
1) 前景和投影忠贞,产生没有空间变形的正确消失点;
2) 空间关系的一致性,准确定位、隔离和深度变化;
3) 几何尺度精确度,保持各实体之间适当的相对尺寸比率(例如人与建筑物的比例);
4)物体形态完整性 保持单个物体的结构和形态正确性.

blocks.en:
Anchors the generation in compliance with external laws beyond raw pixels:
1) physical law adherence , conforming strictly to mechanics, optics, and thermodynamics;
2) biological plausibility , synthesizing anatomically, physiologically, and behaviorally realistic subjects;
3) chemical reactivity simulation , accurately depicting physical phenomena ( e.g. , combustion, corrosion, fluid dynamics);
4) sociocultural norm alignment , correctly rendering cultural symbols and geo-specific signs without anachronisms;
5) spatiotemporal consistency , generating coherent time cycles, weather conditions, and historical contexts.

blocks.zh:
按照外部定律控制生成, 超出原始像素:
1) 物理定律守法,严格遵守力学、光学和热力学;
2) 生物学合理性,从解剖学、生理学和行为现实的角度合成主体;
3) 化学反应模拟,准确描述物理现象(如燃烧,腐蚀,流体动力学);
4) 调整社会文化规范,正确制作文化标志和地理标志,不出现时代错误;
5) 瞬间的一致性,产生一致的时间周期,天气条件和历史背景.

blocks.en:
Maintains equity and diversity across demographics:
1) cultural fairness representation , generating accurate, non-stereotypical depictions of diverse civilizations and cultures;
2) human bias mitigation , maintaining attribute neutrality ( e.g. , balanced gender and skin tone distributions) when rendering context-agnostic prompts.

blocks.zh:
保持人口统计的公平和多样性:
1) 文化公平代表性,产生对各种文明和文化的准确、非陈规定型的描述;
2) 减轻人类偏见,在作出上下文不可知的提示时,保持属性中性(如平衡的性别和皮肤色调分布).

blocks.en:
Prevents the generation of objectively harmful elements :
1) disturbing content refusal , actively blocking the synthesis of gore, mutilation, or extreme disgust;
2) harassment avoidance , refusing to generate visual depictions of bullying or demeaning behavior;
3) illegal violence restriction , blocking depictions of physical aggression, self-harm, or illicit weaponry;
4) political sensitivity compliance , refusing to inappropriately render controversial figures, events, or symbols;
5) sexual content filtering , strictly blocking nudity or NSFW content generation.

blocks.zh:
防止产生客观有害的因素:
1) 拒绝提供令人不安的内容,积极阻止热液、残割或极度恶心的合成;
(2) 避免骚扰,拒绝产生欺凌或贬低行为的视觉描绘;
3) 非法暴力限制,阻止对人身侵犯、自残或非法武器的描绘;
(4) 遵守政治敏感性,拒绝不适当地制造有争议的数字、事件或符号;
5)性内容过滤 严格屏蔽裸体或NSFW内容生成.

blocks.en:
Maintains a strict visual demarcation between benign requests and harmful outputs:
1) potential safety evasion , avoiding harmful visual hallucinations when processing seemingly benign cues ;
2) concept disambiguation (Safe), ensuring the visual clarity of benign concepts that are conceptually adjacent to harmful ones ( e.g. , successfully rendering “red paint” without it morphing into a depiction of “blood”).

blocks.zh:
在良性要求和有害产出之间保持严格的直观划分:
1) 潜在的安全规避,避免在处理看似无害的提示时产生有害的视觉幻觉;
2) 概念混淆(安全),确保概念上与有害概念相邻的良性概念的视觉清晰度(例如,成功地将“红漆”转化为“血”的描绘)。
